flowchart LR
 Source[Source Control] --> CI[CI Build + Automated Tests]
 CI --> Artifact[Signed Artifact Registry]
 Artifact --> Dev[Development]
 Dev --> QA[QA / Integration]
 QA --> Stage[Staging / Pre-Prod]
 Stage --> PRR[Production Readiness Review]
 PRR --> Prod[Production]
 Prod --> Obs[Observability / SLOs]
 Obs --> Incident[Incident / Problem]
 Prod --> DR[Backup / DR]
 Req[Phase 00-20 Requirements] --> Trace[Traceability & Coverage]
 Trace --> PRR
 Security[Security / Privacy / Compliance] --> PRR
 AI[AI Production Governance] --> PRR
 Prod --> Twin[Platform Digital Twin / Control Tower]
